"Poseidon rules the crossing.":"Poseidon menguasai penyeberangan.",
"Every shipped phase ran on the live site before it was announced; the receipts are on <1>/verify</1>. V10 Poseidon is the roadmap now: {0} phases on liquidity and safe crossings between chains, {1} of them live. V9 Achilles is complete, and the roadmaps after V10 already have their names, up to Olympus.":"Setiap fase yang dirilis sudah berjalan di situs langsung sebelum diumumkan; buktinya ada di <1>/verify</1>. V10 Poseidon kini menjadi roadmap: {0} fase tentang likuiditas dan penyeberangan antar-chain yang aman, {1} di antaranya sudah live. V9 Achilles sudah selesai, dan roadmap setelah V10 sudah punya nama, hingga Olympus.",
"Roadmaps":"Peta jalan",
