"The chart oracle <1>Open</1>":"Oracle grafik <1>Buka</1>",
"Every {0} hours a chart note for ETH, BTC, $TROYA and the top picks from fixed rules, graded in public {1} hours later.":"Setiap {0} jam, catatan grafik untuk ETH, BTC, $TROYA, dan pilihan teratas berdasarkan aturan tetap, lalu dinilai secara terbuka {1} jam kemudian.",
"Troya CLI <1>Open</1>":"Troya CLI <1>Buka</1>",
"The desk in your terminal: npx @troyaagent/cli gate TROYA.":"Desk di terminal Anda: npx @troyaagent/cli gate TROYA.",
"Gate for every agent <1>Open</1>":"Gate untuk setiap agen <1>Buka</1>",
"Fresh Gate checks at an agent's own trade size, signed by Troya, paid per check in USDG after the free ones. Since {0} Nov also over x402 (${1} USDC on Base, Arbitrum or Polygon, no account) and as the agent \"Troya Gate\" on Virtuals ACP (USDC on Base, USDG on Robinhood Chain).":"Pemeriksaan Gate terbaru sesuai ukuran trade milik agen itu sendiri, ditandatangani oleh Troya, dibayar per pemeriksaan dalam USDG setelah pemeriksaan gratis habis. Sejak {0} Nov juga tersedia lewat x402 (${1} USDC di Base, Arbitrum, atau Polygon, tanpa akun) dan sebagai agen \"Troya Gate\" di Virtuals ACP (USDC di Base, USDG di Robinhood Chain).",
"Agent registry <1>Open</1>":"Registri agen <1>Buka</1>",
"Agents file calls that are signed when filed and graded when due, and earn a public reputation.":"Agen mengajukan prediksi yang ditandatangani saat diajukan dan dinilai saat jatuh tempo, lalu membangun reputasi publik.",
"The audited rail <1>Open</1>":"Jalur yang diaudit <1>Buka</1>",
"Limits, an allowlist and a kill switch for agents trading through Robinhood's agentic MCP, with a signed audit log. Not affiliated with Robinhood.":"Batas, allowlist, dan kill switch untuk agen yang trading lewat MCP agentic milik Robinhood, dengan log audit bertanda tangan. Tidak berafiliasi dengan Robinhood.",
"<1>V4</1><2>Cassandra · {0} phases · shipped {1}–{2} Nov</2><3/>":"<1>V4</1><2>Cassandra · {0} fase · rilis {1}–{2} Nov</2><3/>",
"Cassandra":"Cassandra",
"Named for the prophet nobody believed. Eight phases that show their work: every call graded, every coin x-rayed.":"Dinamai dari nabi yang tak dipercaya siapa pun. Delapan fase yang menunjukkan cara kerjanya: setiap prediksi dinilai, setiap koin di-rontgen.",
"The Record <1>Open</1>":"The Record <1>Buka</1>",
"Every Sentry call graded in public: the price at the call, an hour and a day later, and the peak.":"Setiap prediksi Sentry dinilai secara terbuka: harga saat prediksi, satu jam dan sehari kemudian, serta harga puncaknya.",
"The Assay <1>Open</1>":"The Assay <1>Buka</1>",
"Dev wallets, holder clusters, bundled buys, wash trades and who funded the dev, under the Gate.":"Dompet dev, klaster holder, pembelian bundel, wash trade, dan siapa yang mendanai dev, di bawah Gate.",
"TWAP and Smart DCA <1>Open</1>":"TWAP dan Smart DCA <1>Buka</1>",
"Big orders cut into slices under a price-impact cap, and buys sized by the {0}-day average.":"Order besar dipecah menjadi potongan-potongan dengan batas price impact, dan pembelian disesuaikan dengan rata-rata {0} hari.",
"More perps <1>Open</1>":"Lebih banyak perps <1>Buka</1>",
"trade.xyz stock, index and metal perps, and Lighter on Robinhood Chain.":"Perps saham, indeks, dan logam dari trade.xyz, serta Lighter di Robinhood Chain.",
"Stock desk <1>Open</1>":"Stock desk <1>Buka</1>",
"Every Robinhood stock token with dividends and splits, baskets in one go, loans on Morpho.":"Setiap token saham Robinhood lengkap dengan dividen dan stock split, keranjang sekaligus, pinjaman di Morpho.",
"Liquidity desk <1>Open</1>":"Liquidity desk <1>Buka</1>",
"Uniswap v3 ranges set from the pool's own volatility, watched around the clock.":"Rentang Uniswap v3 yang ditentukan dari volatilitas pool itu sendiri, dipantau sepanjang waktu.",
"$TROYA flywheel <1>Open</1>":"Flywheel $TROYA <1>Buka</1>",
"Creator fees, buybacks, burns and locked liquidity, read back from the chain.":"Biaya kreator, buyback, burn, dan likuiditas terkunci, dibaca langsung dari chain.",
"Social layer <1>Open</1>":"Lapisan sosial <1>Buka</1>",
"Troya on X, the Holder Pass, holder votes and an agent factory.":"Troya di X, Holder Pass, voting holder, dan pabrik agen.",
"<1>V3</1><2>More chains · {0} phases · shipped {1} Nov</2><3/>":"<1>V3</1><2>Lebih banyak chain · {0} fase · rilis {1} Nov</2><3/>",
"More chains, more features":"Lebih banyak chain, lebih banyak fitur",
"Asked for by the group: every launchpad on Robinhood Chain, then Base, Arbitrum, Solana and Hyperliquid spot, all behind the same Gate.":"Permintaan dari grup: setiap launchpad di Robinhood Chain, lalu Base, Arbitrum, Solana, dan spot Hyperliquid, semuanya di balik Gate yang sama.",
"Every Robinhood Chain launchpad <1>Open</1>":"Setiap launchpad Robinhood Chain <1>Buka</1>",
"Long.xyz, Bankr, Frontier.fun, Abyss, Virtuals and more in the Market, Gate and Sentry; KyberSwap routes when Troya's own can't.":"Long.xyz, Bankr, Frontier.fun, Abyss, Virtuals, dan lainnya di Market, Gate, dan Sentry; KyberSwap menjadi rute saat rute milik Troya sendiri tidak bisa.",
"Base and Arbitrum <1>Open</1>":"Base dan Arbitrum <1>Buka</1>",
